            "body_html": "<h2>Alternative Scenarios</h2>\n<p>These figures show the same projected effects as the Default Scenario tab, but across <strong>all</strong>\nmodeled policy scenarios. Use the <strong>View</strong> toggle to switch between each scenario's own effects\n(levels) and its effect relative to our default scenario (change vs. default).</p>\n<p>Alternatives are a variation on current law. We show one alternative scenario:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Excluding the Section 338 tariffs.</strong> This scenario is identical to current law except that it\n  omits the Section 338 tariff actions on Canadian products, which took effect on August 22.\n  Comparing the default against it isolates the effect of those actions.</li>\n</ul>",
